					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I did not base SCP-049's character in this tale off the Containment Breach games. Although I love the games, they are not my personal headcanon and I only used the content in 049 and 049-J's sources to determine their personalities and strengths. It also wasn't my intention for 049 to be angry enough to kill 049-J, but I guess I see where you're coming from.</p> 
				 	]]>
